WEBVTT

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:32.040
It don't matter how many times we do this.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:34.750
You'll always be down
there on your hands and knees,

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:37.750
gazing up at me with
that pathetic look in your eyes.

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:45.870
In that case... I'll just keep hanging on...
till I knock you flat on your ass.

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:54.700
That was a bitter confrontation.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.120
Just what you'd expect.

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:59.580
Hmph. I was a shoo-in from the get-go.

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:11.330
--Is something wrong?
--Nah.

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:19.870
That was like a death match
between two carnivorous dinosaurs.

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:22.500
It packed quite a punch.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:28.790
Those two may be destined to
keep battling each other from here on out.

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:32.370
I wonder what sort of end awaits them.

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:35.450
Tom, thanks for your fantastic thoughts on that.

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:37.000
But you're neglecting your camera.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.950
Ah. Oh.

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:53.200
Prepare the secret weapon...
for Ramuda Amemura's upcoming battle.

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.950
As you wish.

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:27.370
Damn.

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:30.620
If only I'd held out just a little bit longer,

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:34.120
I could've been more of a help to you, Big Bro.

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:37.580
So, you recognize that, don't you?
You were to blame, Jiro.

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:38.830
Tsk.

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:41.750
You're so spot-on,
there's nothing I can say to that.

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:45.910
But I was even more to blame.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:49.250
Brother Ichi, I'm sorry. Because of me...

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.500
No! <i>I'm </i>the one to blame here!

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:55.040
--But I...
--You two aren't to blame.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.660
You guys did well.

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:00.040
We made the best team.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:03.250
--Big Bro, you mean that?
--Yeah.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:06.120
Brother Ichi, that makes me so happy.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:09.830
All right! Next time we'll be sure not to lose!

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:13.330
The three of us'll beat Yokohoma for sure!

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.160
Argh!

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:19.290
What should I do?

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:22.040
Doppomine, you're too wound up.

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:24.040
A-As soon as we set foot in Chuohku,

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:27.200
my armpits started to get all sweaty,
and my heart started pounding.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:30.410
And to top it all off,
our semifinal match is coming up.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.040
It's okay, man.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.790
Use some sweat pads for your underarms.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:39.040
If your heart's pounding, just practice
rapping to the beat of your pulse.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.410
Just do that, and it'll take the edge off.

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:44.040
I didn't bring any sweat pads with me.

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:46.870
And what do you mean, "the beat of your pulse"?

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:50.750
My heart's pounding
too fast to rap along with it.

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:11.160
Amemura, what on earth are you...

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:20.910
Ooh! Lookin' good!

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:24.660
My arm's gettin' warmed up
for the second battle!

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:29.620
Dear me! Ramuda is nowhere to be found.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:30.830
Huh?

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.500
He prolly went to hit the head or somethin'.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:39.540
Ah-haha! I've been doing exactly
what you told me to do, Lady.

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:41.750
I've been watching Ichiro,
Samatoki, and Jakurai closely

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:45.450
to make sure they don't team up again.

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:48.950
But it's not like that's ever gonna happen.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:53.450
After all, it was all thanks to me
that they broke up in the first place.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:56.000
I never mess up.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:06:01.450
There's no way that their bad blood
and suspicions can be cleared up so easily.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.950
Bring out the secret weapon.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:14.290
This is...

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:17.160
...a true hypnosis mic.

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:23.450
Its powerful hypnotic effect enables its
wielders to brainwash their opponents.

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:25.950
I know that much.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:30.700
But those who wield it must pay the price
for the powerful output it generates.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:35.000
We desire the ability
that Jakurai Jinguji possesses.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:39.370
In order to gain it,
you will make him our puppet.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:42.160
M-Me? For Jakurai?

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:45.120
You cannot refuse.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:49.540
Carrying out this order will
be a testament to your legacy.

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:06.080
It doesn't matter
if I carry out the order or disobey it.

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:07.620
Either way I'm...

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:13.500
Hey there, Ramuda.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:15.370
Where hast thou been?

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:17.080
I stepped out for a bit.

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.750
I was taking a few deep breaths outside.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.370
Thou lookest pale, all things considered.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.910
What? Really?

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:26.700
Oh, I know.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:30.790
I was so busy inhaling, I forgot to exhale.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:38.580
Ah-haha! You okay?

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:42.250
They picked Jakurai over me.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:46.790
On account of Jakurai,
I've gotta say good-bye to this world.

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:49.410
What could be more unfair than this?!

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:52.790
--What's that?
--Eh-hehe.

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:55.330
I've got some luckies in here.

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:56.870
Luckies?

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:58.620
It's a unit of luck.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:07:59.910
What are you talking about?

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:02.500
I do this a lot when I'm broke.

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:07.540
I quantify my luck, turn it into chips,
and make a wager in my mind.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:13.250
During the last battle, I bet on Yokohama,
and--get this--I won 100,000 luckies.

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:15.450
Well, ain't that great.

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:21.200
We got 100,000 luckies here,
so the second battle's gonna be a breeze. Aight?

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:24.540
--Yeah...
--A triumph dependent upon our fortune...

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:26.410
Hmm...

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:28.580
I daresay I must reject such a plot development.

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:31.950
What the--?! Whaddya mean, "plot development"?

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:35.250
Our fight in the second battle.

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:37.540
Since our arrival here,
the words have flowed freely from my pen,

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:39.750
so I am writing about the times ahead.

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:41.250
The times ahead?

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:44.040
'Tis a very, very brief sketch.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.330
No way!

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:46.830
So, what kinda story is it?

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:48.080
I dare not say.

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:50.290
'Tis not quite finished yet.

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:52.750
Aw, c'mon! Just gimme the highlights.

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:54.870
N-A-Y.

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:57.540
Luck... and the times ahead.

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:00.370
These guys have their freedom.

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.950
I, on the other hand...

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:04.790
You've gotta be kidding me.

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:06.950
Why am I the only one
that's gotta say my good-byes?

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:09.750
I can't accept that.

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:12.580
Hold on! That's it!

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:18.370
Using the power of that mic,
I can do to Jakurai what I did to his assistant...

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:23.080
and put him to sleep forever!

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:27.700
If I've gotta lay down my life,
at least I can take Jakurai down with me.

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.540
Jakurai!

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:41.410
The second battle of the
final tournament will begin shortly.

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:45.000
Members of Matenro and Fling Posse,
please get ready

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.120
and make your way to the battle stage.

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:49.330
This is just the thing for that underarm sweat!

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:51.410
O-Okay.

00:09:51.410 --> 00:09:54.330
Doppo. Hifumi.

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:57.200
Let's just be our usual selves out there.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.410
We don't need to do anything different.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:00.910
Y-Yes, sir!

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.000
All right!

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:08.500
We're gonna win this battle!

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:12.700
Come now, let us plunge into the times ahead.

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:16.120
C'mon, Fling Posse, let's go!

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:19.790
We'll put them in their place.

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:32.000
Fling Posse, party of three,
thank you for coming to our club today.

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:39.950
The salesman's cardinal rule is
to research every new client beforehand.

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:44.620
I've got all the data I need... on you three...

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:50.160
Our tale hath already been writ.

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:54.290
Hmph. Any battle's a game of chance.

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:58.000
Amemura.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:01.250
There are many questions I wish to ask you.

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:04.580
I intend to obtain all
the answers during this battle.

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:11.450
I'll put you in a state where none
of that stuff will worry you any longer.

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:13.790
DOC-TOR.

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:18.330
Hmm... Something's...
different about him than usual.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:25.330
White side up means
Fling Posse gets the first attack.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:28.370
Black side up means Matenro gets it.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:34.410
And the first attack goes to... Matenro!

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:40.290
And now, for the second battle!

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:42.620
Get Ready...

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:52.750
Dr. Jakurai. Ramuda.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:58.080
I'll be watching the battle
between you two like a hawk.

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:04.000
Which of you will have
the honor of sluggin' it out with me?

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:09.040
Fling Posse and Matenro...
They look like herbivorous dinosaurs, but...

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:12.500
But there's something unsettling
about that guy Ramuda.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.540
Something's gonna happen... I just know it.

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:26.290
Bring The Beat!!!

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:28.120
I'll bum-rush them!

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:32.250
♬ I don't want to be a bother to any of you ♬

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:35.250
♬ I'd like to make Dr. Jakurai look good, too ♬

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:38.500
♬ I'd really like to win so... I can't lose ♬

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:41.500
♬ Don't walk on through...
without listening to my flow ♬

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:44.910
♬ If I can keep breathing
for sixteen hours at the office ♬

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:46.290
♬ I can make it through eight bars ♬

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:50.700
♬ It'll be an easy victory...
for my superior prowess... ♬

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:54.750
Uh, um... Aaaaah...

00:12:58.120 --> 00:12:59.330
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:00.870
♬ You made the bed
Now you lie in it! ♬

00:13:00.870 --> 00:13:02.700
♬ Pick up your head
And keep the rhymes flowin' 'til the bitter end ♬

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:05.290
♬ What are you waiting for?
Instructions on your headset? ♬

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:08.370
♬ You really make me sick
A corporate drone running on automatic ♬

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:11.330
♬ Just like a lamb to the slaughter
And I'm feelin' mutton for supper! ♬

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:15.040
♬ Hey! Look, a wage slave and a "host"--
a parasite that feeds off of women ♬

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:17.330
♬ Wonderin' if you'll profit off the win?
Wrong question! ♬

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:21.080
♬ You've got an opportunity
to cut your losses and be free ♬

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.620
♬ But you waste your weekends
as a doctor's flunkies? ♬

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:26.950
He's better than I thought.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:30.870
Hmph. My luck is worth 100,000 luckies, you see.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.370
That was awesome!

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:38.660
He hurt two of his foes single-handed!

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:41.160
Shibuya's gained the advantage, huh?

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:43.660
He's not your run-of-the-mill
gambler now, is he?

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:45.500
It appears he's not.

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:50.410
Ramuda, you've assembled yourself a good team.

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:51.790
How are the preparations going?

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:53.410
They are complete.

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:57.290
All we have to do is wait
for them to be put in motion.

00:13:57.290 --> 00:13:59.120
Wh-Wh-What am I gonna do?

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:00.500
It was my fault that...

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:02.040
It's all right.

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:04.870
I'll avenge you, my friend.

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:07.950
Hey, scribbler!

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:14.580
You better brace yourself good
so my rhymes don't tear a hole in your heart!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:20.370
♬ You can't hide inside
Your disguise made of lies ♬

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:23.290
♬ Go out into the city at night
And your nonsense won't fly ♬

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:26.290
♬ Shinjuku: a place of diversity
With a shared disdain for chicanery ♬

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:27.500
♬ The kittens who haunt the darkened streets ♬

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:29.330
♬ Find salvation in the neon glow of the city ♬

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:33.870
♬ The love fandom's where you'll find me
It's my destiny as the King of Normies ♬

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:36.790
♬ Reality's all I've got to warm me
And lying really isn't your forté ♬

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:39.870
♬ Mr. Yumeno
You think you're some catcher of dreams ♬

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:42.080
♬ But all you're catching is stupidity ♬

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.450
Hmph!

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:54.080
"The King of Normies," thou sayest.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:58.370
In that case, I must pay the highest
deference and respect to thee.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:01.500
Well, that is naught but a lie.

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:05.290
♬ The King of Normies?
What a true curiosity ♬

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:06.790
♬ No, no
Believe it or not ♬

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:08.330
♬ You're a king of tragedy
King Lear, really ♬

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:09.580
♬ Absolutely kingly
An emperor almighty ♬

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:11.700
♬ Naked and unsightly
As you lay in your grave ♬

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:14.290
♬ Hifumi Izanami
Your body will wither and you'll cease to be ♬

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:15.870
♬ Clad in a suit only fools can see ♬

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:17.450
♬ Transparent as the false skin you hide behind ♬

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:18.830
♬ Cursed to peel it off along with the day's grime ♬

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:20.750
♬ Thus I adorn thine
Body with this hex of mine ♬

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:22.330
♬ Truth and lies
Are much the same ♬

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:24.870
♬ Like signals in your brain
And all that neon light ♬

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:27.290
♬ Easily extinguished by the dark of night ♬

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:32.000
Hmph!

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:34.120
That was nothing to get all worked up about.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:34.580
Huh?!

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.410
"DIE DIE DIE DIE DIE DIE DIE DIE DIE DIE
DIE DIE DIE DIE DIE DIE DIE DIE DIE DIE"

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.620
Are you all right?

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:43.120
Huh?! What the--?!

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:46.700
Not too bad! When you take them
this far, even lies pack a punch.

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:48.660
Surely, thou jestest.

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:52.500
This humble bard never telleth lies.

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:55.660
I was the one that got Hifumi into this mess.

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:57.330
I'm just a pathetic excuse
for a human being after all.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:16:00.870
--Doctor, are we screwed?
--All I'm cut out to be is a workaholic.

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:04.450
Amemura, here I come!

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:06.700
Please don't look away now.

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:08.830
Of course, Doctor.

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:11.370
Jakurai, you old coot.

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:14.250
♬ The voices you've silenced
And my dear friends you've made fools ♬

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:15.870
♬ Faded colors you've been dyed ♬

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.580
♬ Until you're monochrome through and through ♬

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:20.660
♬ And not a soul can recognize you
Thus, together we shall face ♬

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:23.700
♬ In this time, in this place
All of your pain and heartache ♬

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:26.620
♬ However great or small the case
Be you under sin's poisonous embrace ♬

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:29.290
♬ And within torment confined
Just give me a sign ♬

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:31.370
♬ What were your deeds?
What did you hear and what did you see? ♬

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:35.500
♬ What thoughts drove you to this place?
What reduced you to this wretched state? ♬

00:16:37.450 --> 00:16:39.620
OMG! Would you get off my case?

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:47.080
If you wanna know that bad,
why don't you ask him yourself?

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:48.540
Huh?!

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:51.750
You could enter his dreams...

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:53.790
Hmph!

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:55.370
Eh-heh heh heh heh!

00:16:55.370 --> 00:17:00.160
I'll drag you down to hell with me,
holding hands and all that.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:06.000
Even though the thought of it
makes me wanna puke, you old coot!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:10.620
--Oh!
--Here! You can have my 100,000 luckies!

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:13.950
--Dice...
--Ye have botched your lines.

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:16.750
The hero, with his cheerful and playful
demeanor, is the life of the party

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:20.620
and gloriously defeateth his foes in the end.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:23.000
There must be a splendor about it.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:29.660
Aye, the hero of my tale is... thee.

00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:32.370
The hero?! Me?!

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:35.910
Aye. Therefore, thou shouldest best
your foes in a manner befitting the hero,

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:38.120
befitting thee, Ramuda.

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:41.620
Befitting me...

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:44.120
What is your problem, Amemura?

00:17:51.120 --> 00:17:53.000
--Okay, here I go!
--Huh?!

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:56.540
♬ Ladies, are you watching~?
What a totally boring situation! ♬

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:58.830
♬ Let's escape
With Ramuda's showtime invitation! ♬

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:01.370
♬ Just to see you smile and enjoy yourself ♬

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:04.910
♬ This party, brought to you by Ramuda,
is gettin' an encore--let's go! ♬

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:06.290
♬ Lollipop
Chillhop ♬

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:07.910
♬ OMG, like, so
Looks like the fun's about to start ♬

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:10.950
♬ But first, the toys have got to go ♬

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:14.000
♬ Glimmering, fluttering,
or prattling--it's all dope ♬

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.950
♬ Oops! It's a filthy old dog! Dog poop! ♬

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:19.950
♬ A big, irritating,
self-important mutt, that's who ♬

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.160
♬ Shut up! Shut up! Shut up! Shut up! Shut uuuup! ♬

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:23.620
♬ You're a total eyesore--boo! ♬

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:32.370
Did... his personality change or something?

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:33.660
No.

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:35.290
This is Amemura...

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:36.580
Yay!

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:38.950
...in his natural state.

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:48.540
♬ Everyone needs a little cover
And if you lose it, it's all over ♬

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:51.500
♬ Both hospitals and host clubs
Are places that attract love ♬

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.120
♬ And much the same
In this world ♬

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:54.540
♬ Of perversion
And schemes ♬

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:58.450
♬ So long as the hounds of Matenro attend
Any place shall become heaven ♬

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:04.250
Doctor! You've recharged me!

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:06.870
He's used it without a second thought.

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:09.870
The health recovery skill that they want so bad.

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:12.250
All righty then!

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.750
This time it'll be the three of us!

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:16.000
Together as Fling Posse,
we'll end this with a grand finale!

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:18.410
--Yeah!
--Aye!

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:20.160
--Here they come! Get ready!
--Yes, sir!

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:25.950
♬ That's what I'm talking about!
This is why we're the Posse ♬

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:29.000
♬ A lavish feast of rhyme that goes on endlessly ♬

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:32.080
♬ A literary depository
With every word at my disposal ♬

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:34.950
♬ I don't need a manuscript
To utter words of bliss ♬

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:36.580
♬ Yeah, well, in the meantime-- ♬

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:38.120
♬ Once upon a time... ♬

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:42.620
♬ Killing in kind to share our love
Getting freaky and peaky in no time ♬

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:44.120
♬ That's Fling Posse ♬

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:47.750
♬ No matter what comes,
the Posse'll win while having fun ♬

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:02.290
We did it, ladies!

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:04.200
It was all thanks to you, everybody!

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:11.660
Old man Jakurai, you really are a dummy.

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:15.830
Thanks to you for babysitting
that gigolo and parasite employee.

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:18.160
It's what put you in this sorry state.

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:20.200
Thanks to <i>who</i>?

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:21.410
What?

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:24.950
H-Hey, he's...

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:26.370
What is with him?

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:29.500
D-Doppo?

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:34.410
--Thanks to <i>me</i>, that's who!
--Huh?!

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:35.790
♬ Every last one of them--even that idiot too ♬

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.620
♬ Just runs their mouth,
can you believe it's true? ♬

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:40.410
♬ A thousand hours of overtime accrued,
this lifestyle is utterly screwed ♬

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:42.160
♬ It's all for show--all this
talk of shows, luck, and lies ♬

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:43.790
♬ My stress long since crossed the line ♬

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:46.790
♬ My blood sugar is low,
my productivity shot, and my brain fried ♬

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:49.750
♬ Dear God, I'm begging you, please
I'll be a worthless loser at this rate ♬

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:52.330
♬ All I'm asking for is victory
Oh no, what a shameful display! ♬

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:55.370
♬ I'm already far beyond salvation
Acting only out of desperation ♬

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:56.580
♬ "Death would be a great vacation..." ♬

00:20:56.580 --> 00:21:00.040
♬ If you thought Mr. Doppo
would end it like that, you're mistaken! ♬

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:14.290
God damn it!

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:22.540
H-Huh? What have I done?

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:24.950
Doppo, that was awesome!

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:26.620
What was that?

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:28.500
Beats me...

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:33.830
When your negative emotions reach
their peak, you become sort of invincible.

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:37.250
That must be your skill, Doppo.

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:42.080
Really, Dice.
Those luckies weren't lucky at all!

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:45.830
My bad. I must've used 'em all up.

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:48.870
Who would have thought there
would be an upset at the very end?

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:52.830
OMG, this is so uncool!

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:55.040
And the winner is... Matenro!

00:21:59.200 --> 00:22:01.370
What is the meaning of this?

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:04.410
Was he unable to use it?

00:22:04.410 --> 00:22:06.950
Or did he choose not to?

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:10.250
I believe... it was the latter.

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:18.830
Today is a good day to die.
